cklace-with-fake-in-seconds/articleshow/134509705.cms]]></guid><pubDate>2026-09-27T00:40:46+05:30</pubDate><dc:creator xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/">Poulomi Ghosh</dc:creator><enclosure type="image/jpeg" url="https://static.toiimg.com/photo/msid-134509709,imgsize-96854.cms"/></item><item><title><![CDATA[IShowSpeed opens up about feeling alone despite becoming a global streaming star]]></title><description>&lt;img border="0" hspace="10" align="left" style="margin-top:3px;margin-right:5px;" src="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/photo/134507559.cms" /&gt;<![CDATA[IShowSpeed, the well-known streamer, recently opened up about feeling lonely despite his considerable wealth and fame. He shared how the persona that captivates his audience starkly contrasts with his private life as Darren, creating a sense of isolation. Reflecting on his transformation from struggling financially to becoming a millionaire at a young age, he clarified that wealth was never his true drive.]]></description><link><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/us-streamers/ishowspeed-opens-up-about-feeling-alone-despite-becoming-a-global-streaming-star/articleshow/134507559.cms]]></link><guid><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/us-streamers/ishowspeed-opens-up-about-feeling-alone-despite-becoming-a-global-streaming-star/articleshow/134507559.cms]]></guid><pubDate>2026-09-26T21:57:47+05:30</pubDate><dc:creator xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/">Global Sports Desk</dc:creator><enclosure type="image/jpeg" url="https://static.toiimg.com/photo/msid-134507606,imgsize-933100.cms"/></item><item><title><![CDATA[Drake’s girlfriend Pinkchyu accidentally lifted the curtain on her private life during N3on’s stream]]></title><description>&lt;img border="0" hspace="10" align="left" style="margin-top:3px;margin-right:5px;" src="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/photo/134508174.cms" /&gt;<![CDATA[During an unanticipated moment on N3on’s livestream, Pinkchyu, an established cosplayer and former VTuber, revealed her age as 24, catching both her and viewers off guard. This revelation came shortly after her recent birthday celebration, igniting speculation among fans. Clips showcasing her surprised reaction quickly circulated on social media, sparking discussions about her unexpected disclosure. Pinkchyu has yet to address the matter, leaving many followers pondering her preference for privacy.]]></description><link><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/us-streamers/drakes-girlfriend-pinkchyu-accidentally-lifted-the-curtain-on-her-private-life-during-n3ons-stream/articleshow/134508174.cms]]></link><guid><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/us-streamers/drakes-girlfriend-pinkchyu-accidentally-lifted-the-curtain-on-her-private-life-during-n3ons-stream/articleshow/134508174.cms]]></guid><pubDate>2026-09-26T22:52:51+05:30</pubDate><dc:creator xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/">Global Sports Desk</dc:creator><enclosure type="image/jpeg" url="https://static.toiimg.com/photo/msid-134508224,imgsize-561742.cms"/></item><item><title><![CDATA[Essex siblings ordered to pay £209,000 after cutting down neighbours’ 33-foot Leylandii trees]]></title><description>&lt;img border="0" hspace="10" align="left" style="margin-top:3px;margin-right:5px;" src="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/photo/134481099.cms" /&gt;<![CDATA[Three siblings in Essex have been ordered to pay about £30,500 in damages and £178,668 in legal costs after cutting down their neighbours’ 33-foot Leylandii trees during a long-running boundary dispute. A judge found that they had trespassed into the neighbours’ garden, while the couple said the tree removal destroyed their privacy and affected how they used their home.]]></description><link><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/uk/three-siblings-in-essex-cut-down-their-neighbours-33-foot-leylandii-trees-after-a-boundary-row-the-dispute-ended-with-about-30500-in-damages-and-178668-in-the-neighbours-legal-costs/articleshow/134481099.cms]]></link><guid><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/uk/three-siblings-in-essex-cut-down-their-neighbours-33-foot-leylandii-trees-after-a-boundary-row-the-dispute-ended-with-about-30500-in-damages-and-178668-in-the-neighbours-legal-costs/articleshow/134481099.cms]]></guid><pubDate>2026-09-27T00:00:00+05:30</pubDate><dc:creator xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/">TOI World Desk</dc:creator><enclosure type="image/jpeg" url="https://static.toiimg.com/photo/msid-134481966,imgsize-88804.cms"/></item><item><title><![CDATA[US library cards become unexpected money-saving tool; Brooklyn adds 150,018 members in 2026]]></title><description>&lt;img border="0" hspace="10" align="left" style="margin-top:3px;margin-right:5px;" src="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/photo/134504661.cms" /&gt;<![CDATA[Library cards are evolving into vital tools for Americans seeking to save on entertainment and services. Public libraries are increasing offerings beyond books, including digital content and technology support. Collaborations with local businesses provide discounts and promotions for library cardholders. Significant increases in library memberships indicate changing community needs and economic pressures. Libraries now serve as essential spaces for community engagement without additional costs.]]></description><link><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/us/a-library-card-is-becoming-an-unexpected-money-saving-tool-in-us-one-chicago-area-library-partnered-with-local-businesses-for-discounts-while-brooklyn-added-150018-cardholders-through-august-up-16-from-2-years-earlier/articleshow/134504661.cms]]></link><guid><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/us/a-library-card-is-becoming-an-unexpected-money-saving-tool-in-us-one-chicago-area-library-partnered-with-local-businesses-for-discounts-while-brooklyn-added-150018-cardholders-through-august-up-16-from-2-years-earlier/articleshow/134504661.cms]]></guid><pubDate>2026-09-26T23:00:00+05:30</pubDate><dc:creator xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/">TOI World Desk</dc:creator><enclosure type="image/jpeg" url="https://static.toiimg.com/photo/msid-134504695,imgsize-807824.cms"/></item><item><title><![CDATA[Four artists bought Nina Simone’s childhood home for $95,000, spent nearly $850,000 restoring it]]></title><description>&lt;img border="0" hspace="10" align="left" style="margin-top:3px;margin-right:5px;" src="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/photo/134477648.cms" /&gt;<![CDATA[Nina Simone’s 650 sq ft childhood home in Tryon, North Carolina, has been restored after sitting vacant and severely decayed for more than 20 years. Bought for $95,000 in 2017, the three-room house underwent nearly $850,000 in rehabilitation. The restored home, which retains original features, is expected to open to the public in 2027.]]></description><link><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/us/in-2017-four-artists-paid-95000-to-save-nina-simones-childhood-home-from-demolition-eight-years-later-a-nearly-850000-rehabilitation-restored-the-three-room-north-carolina-house/articleshow/134477648.cms]]></link><guid><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/us/in-2017-four-artists-paid-95000-to-save-nina-simones-childhood-home-from-demolition-eight-years-later-a-nearly-850000-rehabilitation-restored-the-three-room-north-carolina-house/articleshow/134477648.cms]]></guid><pubDate>2026-09-26T23:00:00+05:30</pubDate><dc:creator xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/">TOI World Desk</dc:creator><enclosure type="image/jpeg" url="https://static.toiimg.com/photo/msid-134478363,imgsize-127325.cms"/></item><item><title><![CDATA[Iowa company sent over $800,000 to scammer in 2022; US recovers about $375,000 four years later]]></title><description>&lt;img border="0" hspace="10" align="left" style="margin-top:3px;margin-right:5px;" src="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/photo/134478293.cms" /&gt;<![CDATA[In 2022, an Iowa company transferred over $800,000 to a scammer through a business email compromise scheme. The scam involved fraudulent vendor invoices, which led employees to believe the payments were legitimate. Although the government recovered roughly $375,000, the bulk of the funds remains unrecovered. Investigators traced part of the fraud proceeds to a Wells Fargo account before resorting to legal action.]]></description><link><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/us/an-iowa-company-thought-it-was-paying-legitimate-vendor-invoices-and-transferred-more-than-800000-to-a-scammer-controlled-account-four-years-later-the-us-government-has-recovered-about-375000/articleshow/134478293.cms]]></link><guid><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/us/an-iowa-company-thought-it-was-paying-legitimate-vendor-invoices-and-transferred-more-than-800000-to-a-scammer-controlled-account-four-years-later-the-us-government-has-recovered-about-375000/articleshow/134478293.cms]]></guid><pubDate>2026-09-26T22:00:00+05:30</pubDate><dc:creator xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/">TOI World Desk</dc:creator><enclosure type="image/jpeg" url="https://static.toiimg.com/photo/msid-134478391,imgsize-1667722.cms"/></item><item><title><![CDATA['Stop using threats': China takes veiled shot at US over Cuba &amp; Iran in UN speech]]></title><description>&lt;img border="0" hspace="10" align="left" style="margin-top:3px;margin-right:5px;" src="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/photo/134507178.cms" /&gt;<![CDATA[Chinese Vice President Han Zheng called on the US to respect the sovereignty of Iran and Cuba during his speech. He criticized American actions in the Middle East and urged for an end to the pressure on Cuba. Zheng highlighted the importance of international cooperation among all nations regarding global affairs. His remarks sought to position China as a defender of developing nations.]]></description><link><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/china/stop-using-threats-china-takes-veiled-shot-at-us-over-cuba-iran-in-sharply-critical-un-speech/articleshow/134507178.cms]]></link><guid><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/china/stop-using-threats-china-takes-veiled-shot-at-us-over-cuba-iran-in-sharply-critical-un-speech/articleshow/134507178.cms]]></guid><pubDate>2026-09-26T21:21:25+05:30</pubDate><dc:creator xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/">Pranjal Pandey</dc:creator><enclosure type="image/jpeg" url="https://static.toiimg.com/photo/msid-134507178,imgsize-97962.cms"/></item><item><title><![CDATA[Shocking revelation in Mississippi Black woman's death: Tasia Fortune was killed before body was hung from tree, police say; drug dispute suspected]]></title><description>&lt;img border="0" hspace="10" align="left" style="margin-top:3px;margin-right:5px;" src="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/photo/134506996.cms" /&gt;<![CDATA[]]></description><link><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/us/shocking-revelation-in-mississippi-black-womans-death-tasia-fortune-was-killed-before-body-was-hung-from-tree-police-say-drug-dispute-suspected/articleshow/134506996.cms]]></link><guid><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/us/shocking-revelation-in-mississippi-black-womans-death-tasia-fortune-was-killed-before-body-was-hung-from-tree-police-say-drug-dispute-suspected/articleshow/134506996.cms]]></guid><pubDate>2026-09-26T21:02:56+05:30</pubDate><dc:creator xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/">TOI World Desk</dc:creator><enclosure type="image/jpeg" url="https://static.toiimg.com/photo/msid-134507058,imgsize-35182.cms"/></item><item><title><![CDATA[Missouri teacher loses job after OnlyFans account discovered, says it's been there for years; someone must have searched for it]]></title><description>&lt;img border="0" hspace="10" align="left" style="margin-top:3px;margin-right:5px;" src="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/photo/134506336.cms" /&gt;<![CDATA[]]></description><link><![CDAT