uicide-bomb-blast-near-police-post-in-northwestern-pakistan/articleshow/134503303.cms]]></link><guid><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/pakistan/at-least-12-dead-in-suicide-bomb-blast-near-police-post-in-northwestern-pakistan/articleshow/134503303.cms]]></guid><pubDate>2026-09-26T16:50:56+05:30</pubDate><dc:creator xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/">Karan Manral</dc:creator><enclosure type="image/jpeg" url="https://static.toiimg.com/photo/msid-134504063,imgsize-38641.cms"/></item><item><title><![CDATA[Diana after Diana: How her story kept changing long after her death]]></title><description>&lt;img border="0" hspace="10" align="left" style="margin-top:3px;margin-right:5px;" src="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/photo/134502568.cms" /&gt;<![CDATA[Diana Frances Spencer, known as Princess Diana, remains a significant figure even after her tragic death. Various individuals and institutions construct different portrayals of her character and life experiences. Her brother Charles Spencer recently published a memoir that reflects on her legacy and relationships. Diana's influence persists, shaping identities and resonating in communities around the world.]]></description><link><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/uk/diana-after-diana-how-her-story-kept-changing-long-after-her-death/articleshow/134502568.cms]]></link><guid><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/uk/diana-after-diana-how-her-story-kept-changing-long-after-her-death/articleshow/134502568.cms]]></guid><pubDate>2026-09-26T16:44:05+05:30</pubDate><dc:creator xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/">Prisha Patnaik</dc:creator><enclosure type="image/jpeg" url="https://static.toiimg.com/photo/msid-134502671,imgsize-129620.cms"/></item><item><title><![CDATA[A rubber hose inspired this footwear brand in 2010; 16 years later, Kylian Mbappé has joined its $10B empire]]></title><description>&lt;img border="0" hspace="10" align="left" style="margin-top:3px;margin-right:5px;" src="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/photo/134502675.cms" /&gt;<![CDATA[On, the Swiss footwear brand renowned for its cutting-edge running shoe technology, has successfully broadened its horizons into lifestyle sports and apparel, leading to its public listing. Recently, star footballer Kylian Mbappé joined forces with On, enabling him to influence product creation and strategies for their upcoming football division, with new cleats set for launch in 2027.]]></description><link><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/europe/in-2010-a-rubber-hose-persuaded-a-retired-athlete-to-found-a-footwear-firm-16-years-on-its-a-multi-billion-dollar-company-that-kylian-mbapp-signed-with/articleshow/134502675.cms]]></link><guid><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/europe/in-2010-a-rubber-hose-persuaded-a-retired-athlete-to-found-a-footwear-firm-16-years-on-its-a-multi-billion-dollar-company-that-kylian-mbapp-signed-with/articleshow/134502675.cms]]></guid><pubDate>2026-09-26T16:18:41+05:30</pubDate><dc:creator xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/">TOI World Desk</dc:creator><enclosure type="image/jpeg" url="https://static.toiimg.com/photo/msid-134502741,imgsize-695921.cms"/></item><item><title><![CDATA[Bangladesh jewellery shop owner's body found inside floating drum; Hindu credit union token in pocket]]></title><description>&lt;img border="0" hspace="10" align="left" style="margin-top:3px;margin-right:5px;" src="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/photo/134502587.cms" /&gt;<![CDATA[]]></description><link><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/south-asia/bangladesh-jewellery-shop-owners-body-found-inside-floating-drum-hindu-credit-union-token-in-pocket/articleshow/134502587.cms]]></link><guid><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/south-asia/bangladesh-jewellery-shop-owners-body-found-inside-floating-drum-hindu-credit-union-token-in-pocket/articleshow/134502587.cms]]></guid><pubDate>2026-09-26T16:13:46+05:30</pubD